  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "WebinarJam hosts live marketing webinars with registration pages, reminders, live chat, polls, and timed offers. EverWebinar replays recorded sessions as simulated-live evergreen funnels with just-in-time scheduling, dynamic attendee counts, and automated follow-up. Both are Genesis Digital products in the Kartra family — affiliate catalogue treats them as one marketing webinar entry. Confirm current packaging on webinarjam.com and everwebinar.com.",
